{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Undertone 是一款語音日記 App，讓你在手機上直接口述記錄，並以內建 Whisper AI 在裝置內完成轉錄，音訊與文字不會上傳至伺服器。它適合重視私隱、需要離線記錄想法的人。原價 US $0.99，目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-59.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>裝置內轉錄保障私隱</h2>\n<p>開啟後按下錄音即可口述內容，Whisper AI 會在手機的 Neural Engine 上即時轉成文字，無需連線。你可按需要選擇 Small、Medium 或 Large 模型，在速度與準確度之間取捨；亦能為條目加上標籤、在本機搜尋完整存檔，配合波形精準回放錄音與逐字稿。若想法延續，可把新錄音附加到既有條目，並以單一壓縮檔備份及還原整本日記。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-478-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-479-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-480-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-481-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-482-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-483-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Undertone – Voice Journal</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/undertone-voice-journal/id6761442127?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:24.287389+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":360,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:19:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T17:38:35.792466+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:47.693756+00:00","content_hash":"dede1b2ca5c8b860e7a15971b1dd6e230df07b3f49e77a8379dad5a96763e73c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}